hadiths[2]{hadithnumber,text}:
"27823","Rawh and Abu Nu'aym narrated to us, they said: Hisham ibn Abi Abdillah narrated to us, from Budayl ibn Maysarah, from Safiyyah bint Shaybah, from the umm walad of Shaybah, that she saw the Prophet, peace and blessings of Allah be upon him, while he was running between al-Safa and al-Marwah, saying: The valley floor is not crossed except at a run."
"27824","Affan narrated to us, he said: Hammad ibn Zayd narrated to us, he said: Budayl ibn Maysarah narrated to us, from al-Mughirah ibn Hakim, from Safiyyah bint Shaybah, from a woman among them, that she saw the Prophet, peace and blessings of Allah be upon him, from a skylight while he was running in the belly of the stream, saying: The valley is not crossed except at a run. And I think he said: And the garment had been lifted from his knees. Then Hammad said afterwards: Not crossed, or he said: The valley floor except at a run. And she heard him say: The valley floor is not crossed except at a run."
